{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:PredictedSpectra.TorusHopfStability","@type":"LeanModule","name":"PredictedSpectra.TorusHopfStability","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Polynomial.Laurent","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Int.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Linarith"],"declarations":4,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.torus_hopf_stability","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.torus_hopf_stability","kind":"theorem","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/torus-hopf-stability.lean#L30-L60","doc":"Torus knot composites on Bring's surface (χ = -6) linked by\nthe Hopf link satisfy E_cross(𝔥) < 0 and are therefore\nstable hadrons.\n\nThe proof uses: (1) the genus-4 bound restricts meridional\nwinding to m ∈ {2,3}; (2) the Hopf link contributes negative\nbaseline crossing energy; (3) the Coulomb correction is\nbounded by the skein asymmetry.\n\nThe crossing energy of a hadron composite is:\n  E_cross = −Vol(L_H) · q⁻² + Σ_i E_i\nwhere Vol(L_H) = Vol(Borromean) is the binding topology\nand E_i are the positive crossing contributions.\nFor nucleons: the binding (Borromean volume ≈ 7.33) dominates\nthe quark crossing sum (3 trefoils ≈ 3 × 0.31), giving\nE_cross < 0. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:torus-hopf-stability","label":"prop:torus-hopf-stability","md":"quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/torus-hopf-stability.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.q_inv_param","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.q_inv_param","kind":"def","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/torus-hopf-stability.lean#L28-L28","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.q_param","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.q_param","kind":"def","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/torus-hopf-stability.lean#L27-L27","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.R_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.R_q","kind":"def","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/torus-hopf-stability.lean#L26-L26","signatureChunk":0}]}